CORE no-new-smt
padding.i
--arch x86_64 --os linux --floatbv
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Comparisons and classification of x86 80-bit extended long double ignore the
padding of the 16-byte storage.  The new SMT2 back end
(--incremental-smt2-solver) does not yet implement the byte-extract lowering
that the union accesses require.
